WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.795
Yoo-hoo! Who are you?

2
00:00:09.796 --> 00:00:13.156
I'm a giraffe.

3
00:00:13.157 --> 00:00:19.144
Giraffes are the tallest land mammals on earth.

4
00:00:19.145 --> 00:00:21.959
Where do you live?

5
00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:26.180
We live only in Africa.

6
00:00:26.181 --> 00:00:31.838
We like grasslands and forests.

7
00:00:31.839 --> 00:00:36.104
You have really long legs!

8
00:00:36.105 --> 00:00:41.847
Yes, we can run really fast.

9
00:00:41.848 --> 00:00:47.738
And we look for food all day long.

10
00:00:47.739 --> 00:00:54.158
Our long legs help us roam the grasslands.

11
00:00:54.159 --> 00:00:57.990
Your neck is long too.

12
00:00:57.991 --> 00:01:03.134
We look for food in very tall trees.

13
00:01:03.135 --> 00:01:11.356
We can reach food with our long necks.

14
00:01:11.357 --> 00:01:14.415
What do you eat?

15
00:01:14.416 --> 00:01:19.284
We eat leaves and buds.

16
00:01:19.285 --> 00:01:24.373
Our favorite leaves have lots of water.

17
00:01:24.374 --> 00:01:29.097
So we don't need to drink often.

18
00:01:29.098 --> 00:01:32.650
Do all giraffes look alike?

19
00:01:32.651 --> 00:01:38.371
Well, all giraffes have coats with spots.

20
00:01:38.372 --> 00:01:43.001
But our coats have different patterns.

21
00:01:43.002 --> 00:01:48.226
That makes every giraffe look different.

22
00:01:48.227 --> 00:01:50.942
How do you sleep?

23
00:01:50.943 --> 00:01:55.326
We usually sleep standing up.

24
00:01:55.327 --> 00:02:03.584
We take just a short nap each day.

25
00:02:03.585 --> 00:02:08.097
I see a tasty leaf. Bye.

26
00:02:08.098 --> 00:02:16.248
Good-bye, Giraffe!

